## Security Scanning

[Semgrep](https://semgrep.dev) scans every pull request and push to `main` (`.github/workflows/semgrep.yml`). Findings fail the check.

Create a token at [semgrep.dev](https://semgrep.dev/orgs/-/settings/tokens) and add it as a repository secret:

```bash
gh secret set SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN
```

